        "X1 is a functional placeholder: no internal circuit or approved power-inhibit implementation exists.",
        "Battery is deliberately unconnected. A 3S pack reaches 12.6V; motor limits, BMS, charger and fusing need review.",
        "VMOTOR_SW and 5V_ACT require independent hardware inhibition, disabled boot and explicit re-arm.",
        "Common GND is a signal reference; route motor/servo returns separately from logic. Wire sizes and protection TBD.",
        "5V_LOGIC powers modules only; never connect 12V to ESP headers. Disconnect external 5V before USB power."
